# Restart in Windows (docs/bridge.md at the root of the product): members of
# wheel may set the firmware's BootNext, and nothing else, without a password.
# The argument is a sudo regular expression (sudo 1.9.10 and later): exactly
# --bootnext and four hex digits, so no other efibootmgr option gets through.
# Installed mode 0440 by scripts/apply-system.sh --bridge after visudo -cf.
%wheel ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/efibootmgr ^--bootnext [0-9A-Fa-f]{4}$
